# The show is staged here by the `stageWeb` Sync task, and `verifyWeb` refuses to
# build if it disagrees with `Web/`. It is a copy of a tracked tree, so tracking
# it too would only create a second place for it to be stale.
app/src/main/assets/Web/

# Gradle and the Android build.
.gradle/
build/
app/build/
local.properties

# The signing key and its passwords. The key is not a secret in the sense of
# being anybody's identity — it is self-signed and signs nothing but this app —
# but it is the thing that decides whether the next .apk is accepted as an
# update, so it lives on disk and not in the repository.
keystore/
keystore.properties

# Homebrew's cask installs the command line tools somewhere on the machine, but
# if anyone ever points `ANDROID_HOME` inside the tree, this catches it.
sdk/

# Temporary local Gradle distribution used only to bootstrap the checked-in
# wrapper. The wrapper is the reproducible project tool; this bulky download is
# neither source nor a release artifact.
tools/

.DS_Store
*.iml
.idea/
